Which of the two licenses applies
---------------------------------

This project takes the OpenIB.org BSD branch, and every file under src/ and
tools/ is distributed under those terms.  The GPL-2.0 branch is named above
because the upstream files offer a choice and the text is reproduced verbatim
so that both branches remain readable from this one file.

The vendored files under vendor/freebsd-src/ each already carry their own full
license text, unchanged, and that text governs those files.
